{"id":"00607","root":"uni00607_1","name":{"ja":"心願寺　紅","en":"Shinganji Kurenai"},"title":{"ja":"【BLACK LAGOON】","en":"【Black Lagoon】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【BLACK LAGOON】 心願寺　紅","en":"【Black Lagoon】 Shinganji Kurenai"},"element":"Science","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2022-07-31","limited":true,"characterId":6,"profile":{"ja":"吸血鬼と人間のハーフでありながら対魔忍として生きる異端の存在。祖父である“ふうま八将”心願寺幻庵から剣術の指南を受け、ゆくゆくは八将を継ぐと目されていた実力者。しかし、かつてのふうま宗家の反乱に連座して幻庵は失脚。跡目を継ぐはずだった紅もふうまの里を離れ、現在は闇の都市として名高いセンザキを拠点に独自に活動している。彼女が信じる“義”のために。","en":"She is a half-vampire, half-human outcast who lives as a Taimanin. She received swordsmanship instruction from her grandfather, the Fuuma Eight-General Shinganji Gen-an, and was once slated to inherit his position. However, because her grandfather was disgraced for aiding the Fuuma main family during an internal conflict, Kurenai left the Fuuma village and now operates independently with no allegiance. From her former Fuuma Eight-General lineage she is also an old acquaintance of Fuuma Kotaro, the heir of the main family. She can deliberately unleash the dormant \"demon\" power within herself to gain overwhelming strength. When she does, her eyes turn crimson, black wings sprout on her back, and she becomes surrounded by a miasma of darkness. In this demonic awakening, Kurenai possesses a terrifying power far beyond that of ordinary humans, but the price is that her body and mind are gradually consumed by the demon, causing her to lose her humanity and will over time."},"illustrator":"ZOL","voiceActor":"かざりゆえ","forms":[{"id":"uni00607_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[934,1868],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[192,384],"def":[112,224],"spd":[42,42],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["5","1560011"]},{"id":"uni00607_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1368,2736],"sp":[260,260],"atk":[319,638],"def":[159,318],"spd":[42,42],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["5","1560011","156